<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Meet Your Bartender | Pour Live Private Bartending</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --night:#0E0D0C;
    --panel:#151311;
    --cream:#F6F0E6;
    --amber:#F2A33A;
    --line:#2A2724;
    --muted:#BDB5A8;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing:border-box;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
  }

  html {
    background:var(--night);
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    width:100%;
  }

  body {
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    width:100%;
    min-height:100%;
    background:var(--night);
    color:var(--cream);
    font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.65;
  }

  /* Navigation Bar Styles (Stacked Logo on Mobile) */
  .site-nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(14, 13, 12, 0.95);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }

  .site-nav .in {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .site-nav .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .site-nav .logo .pour {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: .82;
    letter-spacing: .03em;
  }

  .site-nav .logo .live {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: .5em;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .site-nav .logo .live i {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--amber);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .site-nav nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px 18px;
  }

  .site-nav nav a {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font: 500 14px Inter, sans-serif;
    transition: color .15s ease;
  }

  .site-nav nav a:hover,
  .site-nav nav a.active {
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .site-nav nav a.nav-cta {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--night);
    padding: 7px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .site-nav nav a.nav-cta:hover {
    background: #FFC06A;
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:40px 24px 120px;
  }

  .hero {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0,5fr) minmax(0,7fr);
    gap:40px;
    align-items:center;
  }

  .photo {
    position:relative;
  }

  .photo img {
    width:100%;
    aspect-ratio:4/5;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:24px;
    display:block;
    background:var(--panel);
  }

  .badge {
    position:absolute;
    left:16px;
    bottom:16px;
    background:var(--night);
    border:1px solid var(--amber);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:8px 16px;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:14px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
  }

  .badge i {
    width:8px;
    height:8px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--amber);
    display:inline-block;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color:var(--amber);
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0 0 6px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    font-size:96px;
    line-height:.85;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    margin:0 0 14px;
  }

  .role {
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0 0 16px;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin:0 0 12px;
    max-width:58ch;
    color:#E6DFD3;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    font-size:36px;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    margin:56px 0 16px;
  }

  .grid {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));
    gap:16px;
  }

  .card {
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:18px;
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:22px;
  }

  .card h3 {
    margin:0 0 6px;
    font-size:18px;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .card p {
    margin:0;
    color:#E6DFD3;
  }

  .beyond {
    margin-top:56px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:24px;
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:32px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);
    gap:32px;
    align-items:start;
  }

  .beyond h2 {
    margin-top:0;
  }

  .beyond p {
    margin:0 0 12px;
    color:#E6DFD3;
  }

  .skills {
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    list-style:none;
  }

  .skills li {
    border:1px solid var(--amber);
    color:var(--cream);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:8px 16px;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:15px;
  }

  .link {
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:8px;
    color:var(--amber);
    font-weight:700;
    text-decoration:none;
  }

  .link:hover {
    text-decoration:underline;
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top:40px;
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:28px;
    background:var(--amber);
    color:var(--night);
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:16px;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
  }

  .cta h3 {
    font-family:'Bebas Neue',Impact,sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    font-size:36px;
    margin:0;
    line-height:1;
  }

  .cta p {
    margin:4px 0 0;
  }

  .btn {
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    min-height:50px;
    padding:0 24px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:var(--night);
    color:var(--cream);
    font-weight:700;
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:background .15s ease;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background:#2A2724;
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline:3px solid var(--cream);
    outline-offset:2px;
  }

  .foot {
    margin-top:56px;
    padding-top:24px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--muted);
  }

  .foot a {
    color:var(--cream);
    text-decoration:none;
  }

  .foot a:hover {
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  @media (max-width:768px){
    .site-nav .in {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .site-nav nav {
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px 14px;
    }
    .site-nav nav a {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .hero, .beyond {
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size:72px;
    }
    .photo img {
      aspect-ratio:1/1;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Navigation Bar -->
  <header class="site-nav">
    <div class="in">
      <a class="logo" href="/">
        <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M50 8 C46 15 41 21 41 27 A9 9 0 0 0 59 27 C59 21 54 15 50 8 Z" fill="#F2A33A"/>
          <path d="M18 44 L82 44 Q78 66 50 68 Q22 66 18 44 Z" fill="none" stroke="#F6F0E6" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          <path d="M50 68 L50 88 M36 90 L64 90" fill="none" stroke="#F6F0E6" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <div class="pour">POUR</div>
          <div class="live"><i></i>LIVE</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/book-your-bartender">Book Your Bartender</a>
        <a href="/meet-your-bartender" class="active" aria-current="page">Meet Your Bartender</a>
        <a href="/faqs">FAQs</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/14Jmei1JewZq9f1ADkIHuH1RM6OTibVE7=w1200" alt="Trey, founder and lead bartender of Pour Live">
        <div class="badge"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Founder &amp; Lead Bartender</div>
      </div>
      <div class="intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet your bartender</p>
        <h1>Hi, I'm Trey</h1>
        <p class="role">Founder &amp; Lead Bartender, Pour Live</p>
        <p>I started Pour Live to bring the feel of a great bar to your own backyard, venue, or living room: good drinks, fast service, and a bartender who keeps the energy right from the first pour to last call.</p>
        <p>I've been behind the bar since college, more than 10 years of slinging drinks, reading crowds, and keeping parties moving. Ask me what I love to make and you'll get three answers: a bright, salty <b>Paloma</b>, a fresh-muddled <b>Mojito</b>, and, when the night calls for it, an <b>AMF</b> that lives up to its name.</p>
        <p>When you book Pour Live, you're not getting a random temp. You're getting me, or a bartender I've personally trained to the same standard.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2>What I bring to your event</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Hospitality first</h3>
        <p>Reading the room, remembering faces, and keeping lines short so your guests feel taken care of all night.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Drinks done right</h3>
        <p>Classic cocktails made properly, plus custom signature drinks designed around your event, theme, or favorite flavors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Zero stress for you</h3>
        <p>A shopping list before the event, setup before guests arrive, and the bar cleaned up when the night's done.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Safe, responsible service</h3>
        <p>IDs checked, no serving minors or anyone who's had too much, so the party stays fun for everyone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="beyond">
      <div>
        <h2>Beyond the bar</h2>
        <p>Behind the bar, I'm a builder. I also work in web design, branding, marketing, UX/UI, and automation, which is why booking Pour Live is so easy.</p>
        <p>This site, the logo, the instant estimate calculator, and the quote that lands in your inbox seconds after you request a date? I designed and built all of it. The same attention to detail goes into every event.</p>
        <p>Run a small business and need a website that actually brings in customers? I build those too.</p>
        <a class="link" href="https://www.webrite.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See my web design work at WebRite</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="skills" aria-label="Trey's other skills">
        <li>Web design</li>
        <li>Branding</li>
        <li>Marketing</li>
        <li>UX/UI</li>
        <li>Automation</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="cta">
      <div>
        <h3>Let's make your event one to remember</h3>
        <p>See your estimate instantly and request your date.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="/book-your-bartender">Book Trey</a>
    </div>

    <p class="foot">© 2026 Pour Live · Private bartending in the Inland Empire &amp; Los Angeles · <a href="mailto:bookpourlive@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">bookpourlive@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
